-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----
REPLACE THIS FILE WITH YOUR ACTUAL RDS SSH PRIVATE KEY

To generate a new key pair:
  ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f nvmet-csi-key -C "nvmet-csi"

Then copy this file:
  cp nvmet-csi-key deploy/kubernetes/rds-private-key

And add the public key to your RDS:
  # On RouterOS:
  /user ssh-keys import public-key-file=nvmet-csi-key.pub user=metal-csi
-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----
